AB  - Bronchial thermoplasty is an innovative treatment for patients with severe asthma 
      and chronic airflow obstruction with an established long-term efficacy and safety 
      profile. This review focuses on the role of bronchial thermoplasty in severe 
      asthma, its mechanism of action, appropriate patient selection, current evidence, 
      and recent developments of this therapy.
