TI  - Chinese consensus statement on standard procedure and perioperative management of 
      bronchial thermoplasty.
PG  - 5507-5514
LID - 10.21037/jtd.2017.12.25 [doi]
AB  - Bronchial thermoplasty (BT) is a non-pharmacologic therapy for severe asthma. The 
      proper procedure and perioperative management are very important for the 
      effectiveness and safety of BT. China Asthma Alliance assembled a group of 
      experts in asthma and BT to review the literature, drew on their own experiences, 
      discussed, and then finalized by consensus to establish this standard practice 
      guideline. This practice guideline is designed to guide clinicians as to proper 
      patients' selection, preoperative assessment, postoperative management and 
      follow-up. This practice guideline also proposed "China Alair System Registry 
      Study (NCT02206269)" as the real-world study to enhance clinical utility of BT.
